  "pageshortdescription": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "shortDescTitle": "<p><b>Vitoss Synthetic Bone Graft Substitute</b></p>\r\n",
    "shortDescTop": "<p>Vitoss is a highly porous beta-tricalcium phosphate (up to 90% porous)<sup>1</sup> with clinical research demonstrating efficacy in a variety of anatomical locations.<sup>2</sup> Vitoss can be hydrated with bone marrow aspirate (BMA), whole blood, or saline. It is available in a variety of forms including moldable packs, malleable strips, and morsels.</p>\r\n",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-1f15d09fdf@example.invalid",
    "hideComponent": "false",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Aug 06 2025 16:52:51 GMT+0000",
    "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/pageshortdescription",
    "textIsRich": [
      "true",
      "true",
      "true"
    ],
    "bulletList": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Open, interconnected structure designed to allow for 3-D bone regeneration.<sup>3</sup></p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>When combined with bone marrow aspirate (BMA), the mixture possesses the same three bone healing components as the gold standard (Iliac Crest Bone Graft, or ICBG) – a scaffold (osteoconductive), cells (osteogenic*) and signals (osteoinductive*).<sup>4</sup></p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Vitoss Foam Pack is stable in a fluid environment, can soak and hold various hydration fluids, and is moldable</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "4": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Vitoss Foam Strip is flexible when wet, can soak and hold various hydration fluids, is compression resistant, and is easy to cut</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "5": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Vitoss Morsels and Blocks are good for large graft volume applications and are cost comparable to cancellous chips</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      }
    }
  },
  "disclaimer": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
    "disclaimer-type": "text",
    "disclaimer": "<p><b style=\"font-size: 0.8125rem;\">References:</b></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Stryker Test Report: 1070-0008R.</li>\r\n<li>Vitoss bibliography: 5701-0002</li>\r\n<li>Stryker Test Report: 1050-0003R.</li>\r\n<li>Bellincampi, L., Clineff, T., Erbe, E., Osteoinductivity of Vitoss with Isologous Bone Marrow in Urist Rat Pouch Model. Society for Biomaterials. Tampa, FL. April 24-27, 2002 (Podium).</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>Based on&nbsp;BIVIT-WB-7_16134</p>\r\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Aug 05 2025 21:02:39 GMT+0000",
    "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/structure/disclaimer",
    "textIsRich": "true"
  },
  "image": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "fileReference": "/content/dam/stryker/trauma-and-extremeties/products/vitossandimbibe/images/vitoss-image1.jpg"
  },
  "rte": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>*Vitoss alone is not osteoinductive or osteogenic. Studies have demonstrated that BMA contains components with the potential to support bone healing via osteogenic and osteoinductive pathways.</p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Aug 05 2025 21:02:43 GMT+0000",
    "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
    "textIsRich": "true"
  }
}
